WEBVTT

00:00:22.210 --> 00:00:26.970
Seeking out a single ray of light,
hito-suji no hikari wo motome

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:34.210
All I can do is wander on, no matter how far.
hitasura doko made mo tada samayou

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:42.950
As I breathe a sigh not unlike surrender,
akirame ni nita tameiki wo tsuki-nagara

00:00:43.010 --> 00:00:52.270
I don't want to fear how I've been hurt, all the time.
kizutsuku koto wo osoretaku nai yo itsu mo

00:00:52.410 --> 00:00:54.650
Set me free now!

00:00:54.670 --> 00:01:01.060
Come on, let it all go, to the far reaches of time,
saa tokihanate subete toki no kanata ni

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:01.080
From that which binds the soul!
tamashii wo shibaru mono wo

00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:06.910
tamashii wo shibaru mono wo
From that which binds the soul!

00:01:06.950 --> 00:01:09.200
For my heartbeat!

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:11.690
Make freedom your weapon,
jiyuu wo buki ni

00:01:11.690 --> 00:01:11.760
And you are sure to attain it!
kitto te ni ireru no yo

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:15.470
kitto te ni ireru no yo
And you are sure to attain it!

00:01:15.470 --> 00:01:15.510
The power to believe and dream is there
shinjiru chikara wo yume wo

00:01:15.510 --> 00:01:21.590
shinjiru chikara wo yume wo
The power to believe and dream is there

00:01:21.590 --> 00:01:21.630
for you to go on living.
ikite yuku tame ni

00:01:21.630 --> 00:01:25.960
ikite yuku tame ni
for you to go on living.

00:01:46.150 --> 00:01:51.160
Well done, everyone. As a result of your activities,

00:01:51.160 --> 00:01:53.760
we have recovered roughly 30,000 capsules.

00:01:53.760 --> 00:01:55.660
We were also able to defend the military station...

00:01:55.660 --> 00:02:01.170
what could be called the heart of Second Earth... from Tony Frost's improvidence.

00:02:01.170 --> 00:02:06.400
I think we can say that we have finally gotten through this crisis.

00:02:08.510 --> 00:02:14.850
However, the truth is that in order to do so, we have paid a great sacrifice.

00:02:14.850 --> 00:02:17.080
Now that we have lost the medical station,

00:02:17.080 --> 00:02:21.190
we as mankind have been made to stand at a great crossroads,

00:02:21.190 --> 00:02:24.990
where we need to earnestly consider how we are going to maintain our survival.

00:02:30.860 --> 00:02:33.730
Before we determine our future,

00:02:33.730 --> 00:02:40.810
I think we should make clear everything about what chain of events brought us here.

00:02:40.810 --> 00:02:47.550
Indeed, the High Council that has lead us up until now has committed a terrible mistake.

00:02:47.550 --> 00:02:52.420
- Don't push!
- Let me go! I can walk by myself!

00:02:58.160 --> 00:02:59.490
You traitor...

00:02:59.490 --> 00:03:03.230
In order to sweep the Blue off of the Earth's surface,

00:03:03.230 --> 00:03:07.170
they recovered the Sleepers, who possess the same B cells as the Blue,

00:03:07.170 --> 00:03:08.970
and through the Double Edges,

00:03:08.970 --> 00:03:13.170
artificially amplified their dormant battle abilities.

00:03:13.170 --> 00:03:17.510
In other words, they took the dangerous gamble of fighting poison with poison.

00:03:17.510 --> 00:03:20.850
However, sure enough, they failed.

00:03:20.850 --> 00:03:24.180
Activating the B cells gave rise to the Sleepers' rashness,

00:03:24.180 --> 00:03:28.520
and as a result, gave rise to this current tragedy.

00:03:28.520 --> 00:03:30.990
Having forcibly moved that plan forward,

00:03:30.990 --> 00:03:33.130
they bear a heavy responsibility for this.

00:03:33.130 --> 00:03:35.130
How dare you speak so self-servingly!

00:03:35.130 --> 00:03:40.800
It was the science section that you were in that was responsible for part of that plan!

00:03:40.800 --> 00:03:46.970
Our plan was based on the provision that the Sleepers could be perfectly controlled.

00:03:46.970 --> 00:03:51.480
This is the result of carelessly raising their powers.

00:03:51.480 --> 00:03:57.150
We should no longer sully our hands with such dangerous gambles.

00:03:57.150 --> 00:04:01.520
Are you saying then that there is another way to take back the Earth?

00:04:03.490 --> 00:04:06.830
I wonder if you are aware of the following...

00:04:06.830 --> 00:04:09.290
Among each of the cells of living things,

00:04:09.290 --> 00:04:12.160
a capacity for them to kill themselves is provided.

00:04:12.160 --> 00:04:16.840
In every cell, there is something you could call a suicide order,

00:04:16.840 --> 00:04:21.840
issued down under a certain set of conditions, already programmed into them.

00:04:21.840 --> 00:04:26.850
This is projected cell death, or "Planned Suicide."

00:04:26.850 --> 00:04:32.440
As Tony Frost so aptly called it, this is the grand will of the Earth.

00:04:33.450 --> 00:04:35.790
<i>Will of the Earth...?</i>

00:04:35.790 --> 00:04:39.460
If the Earth were to be thought of as a single life form,

00:04:39.460 --> 00:04:41.130
then compared with other cells,

00:04:41.130 --> 00:04:43.460
those that are remarkably more evolved and propagating...

00:04:43.460 --> 00:04:50.800
that would be mankind... would be the cells that need to commit suicide.

00:04:50.800 --> 00:04:54.970
The birth of the Blue was a type of "Planned Suicide"

00:04:54.970 --> 00:05:00.280
enacted by the Earth's genes in order to eliminate an unnecessary portion of mankind.

00:05:01.810 --> 00:05:06.220
It can be thought that the current incident with Tony Frost was due to the workings of his B cells,

00:05:06.220 --> 00:05:09.490
in order for them to play out their original role.

00:05:09.490 --> 00:05:15.060
In the end, the Sleepers as well were born and exist as mankind's natural enemy,

00:05:15.060 --> 00:05:17.500
just as the Blue were.

00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:24.400
B cells are mankind's greatest menace. Tony's rashness is proof of that.

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:28.170
I- it can't be...!

00:05:28.170 --> 00:05:32.110
Just a moment, Seno Miyagi! What about Yuji?

00:05:32.110 --> 00:05:34.780
Of course, there are exceptions.

00:05:34.780 --> 00:05:39.080
We are grateful to you for your recent actions.

00:05:41.790 --> 00:05:43.890
However, now that things have come to this,

00:05:43.890 --> 00:05:47.130
there is only one road ahead of us.

00:05:47.130 --> 00:05:52.800
And that is to make Second Earth here the place where we can live in peace!

00:05:52.800 --> 00:05:54.130
What!?

00:05:54.130 --> 00:05:56.760
You're out of your mind! Dammit!

00:06:01.140 --> 00:06:04.810
Having lost the medical station, and with limited resources,

00:06:04.810 --> 00:06:06.480
it will likely be difficult to survive.

00:06:06.480 --> 00:06:12.480
However, we still have both the military and the education stations.

00:06:12.480 --> 00:06:17.160
On Earth, from here on as well, there is no doubt that the Blue... rather,

00:06:17.160 --> 00:06:22.330
the B cells will continue to repeat their endless evolution and propagation.

00:06:22.330 --> 00:06:25.160
In which case...

00:06:25.160 --> 00:06:29.330
...we ourselves will bid farewell to that planet without hope!

00:06:29.330 --> 00:06:34.110
As long as we remain here, we will be safe and free.

00:06:34.110 --> 00:06:36.310
By doing so, for the first time,

00:06:36.310 --> 00:06:44.340
we as humans will obtain the right to live out the remaining time we have as human beings.

00:06:52.120 --> 00:06:57.230
Let us together build an ideal community of peace and quiet for mankind!

00:06:57.230 --> 00:07:01.270
Let us make this Second Earth our promised land,

00:07:01.270 --> 00:07:04.600
and become her truly chosen people!

00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:17.480
<i>If that is really true,</i> <i>then for what reason have I...</i>

00:08:17.480 --> 00:08:19.810
<i>... have I...</i>

00:08:19.810 --> 00:08:21.810
Yuji...

00:08:21.810 --> 00:08:24.870
What's wrong? You're not very cheerful.

00:08:32.090 --> 00:08:34.990
Were you thinking about what Seno said?

00:08:34.990 --> 00:08:39.400
If so, there's not really anything that should concern you.

00:08:40.430 --> 00:08:44.100
He just doesn't understand you, Yuji, and so...

00:08:44.100 --> 00:08:45.090
Marlene...

00:08:48.110 --> 00:08:51.110
For what reason have I been fighting up until now?

00:08:51.110 --> 00:08:54.880
A great deal of friends have died, and only I have survived...

00:08:54.880 --> 00:08:58.780
In the end, I was unable to save anybody.

00:08:58.780 --> 00:09:01.950
To what end did I awaken!?

00:09:01.950 --> 00:09:06.190
If what Seno said is true, then I... I...

00:09:08.130 --> 00:09:13.630
Yuji, you've fought as hard as you could to take back the Earth...

00:09:13.630 --> 00:09:17.470
None of this is your fault, Yuji. So...

00:09:17.470 --> 00:09:19.600
...don't blame yourself.

00:09:19.600 --> 00:09:23.480
You're better off not thinking about something you don't need to.

00:09:23.480 --> 00:09:25.480
Marlene...

00:09:25.480 --> 00:09:30.150
Seno has chosen to live here on Second Earth.

00:09:30.150 --> 00:09:31.750
That's all.

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:39.090
But that doesn't change the fact that I carry the B cells! I...

00:09:39.090 --> 00:09:42.430
I was not awakened to prove Seno's theory!

00:09:42.430 --> 00:09:48.090
Neither were Tony and Alicia! They did not die for that!

00:09:49.100 --> 00:09:52.440
And yet... dammit...!

00:09:52.440 --> 00:09:54.340
Yuji!

00:09:56.110 --> 00:09:57.470
Yuji...

00:10:19.460 --> 00:10:20.560
Alicia...

00:10:31.410 --> 00:10:33.930
Amick Hendar, your food.

00:10:53.430 --> 00:10:57.460
Hmph! I am not about to stay in this ridiculous place forever!

00:11:00.440 --> 00:11:02.110
Hey, Amick!

00:11:02.110 --> 00:11:05.470
You've done nicely, haven't you? Open mine up, too!

00:11:08.110 --> 00:11:12.120
Didn't you hear me? I'll yell!

00:11:12.120 --> 00:11:15.450
Go ahead and try, you worthless scum.

00:11:15.450 --> 00:11:19.460
Come to mention it, I owe you quite a bit.

00:11:19.460 --> 00:11:21.460
W- wait! Don't be hasty!

00:11:21.460 --> 00:11:25.800
You couldn't possibly think you'll succeed in escaping by yourself!

00:11:25.800 --> 00:11:28.430
If you let me out of here, I'll assist you!

00:11:28.430 --> 00:11:31.140
Let me handle the matters of the military station!

00:11:31.140 --> 00:11:34.640
Honest! All I want is Seno Miyagi...

00:11:34.640 --> 00:11:39.140
to dispose of that guy for betraying the High Council!!

00:11:39.140 --> 00:11:41.540
So, please!

00:11:43.820 --> 00:11:47.110
Hmph, it would seem as if that's true.

00:12:13.510 --> 00:12:16.510
Still, with us suddenly not having anything to do, you know...?

00:12:16.510 --> 00:12:19.850
Can't do anything about it until some other orders come.

00:12:19.850 --> 00:12:23.520
For now, should we go with our usual menu?

00:12:23.520 --> 00:12:25.190
It's Kaido Yuji.

00:12:25.190 --> 00:12:28.030
He's a Sleeper, right?

00:12:28.030 --> 00:12:31.200
Weren't those who have B cells supposed to be our enemy?

00:12:31.200 --> 00:12:34.130
- What do we do?
- Let's go.

00:12:55.820 --> 00:12:58.820
Amick Hendar has broken into a shuttle bus.

00:12:58.820 --> 00:13:02.160
Hold your fire! Send more personnel and wait for further orders!

00:13:06.160 --> 00:13:08.870
Amick, stop this foolishness!

00:13:08.870 --> 00:13:12.840
Stand down from the shuttle and surrender peacefully!

00:13:12.840 --> 00:13:14.510
Hmph, Seno, huh?

00:13:14.510 --> 00:13:16.980
Just perfect! Open the dock!

00:13:16.980 --> 00:13:19.840
Otherwise, I'll punch through it with the shuttle's lasers!

00:13:19.840 --> 00:13:24.180
What the hell do you intend to do? The fight is over now.

00:13:24.180 --> 00:13:30.190
It's not over! Not until we take back the Earth from those bugs!

00:13:30.190 --> 00:13:31.790
Seno, what's wrong?

00:13:31.790 --> 00:13:33.460
Yuji, it's Amick!

00:13:33.460 --> 00:13:35.730
What can you do by yourself?

00:13:35.730 --> 00:13:38.800
Once you land on Earth, all that's left is for you to die!

00:13:38.800 --> 00:13:41.700
I can see what lies ahead if I stay here.

00:13:41.700 --> 00:13:44.800
It's just a matter of time before the resources are depleted, right?

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:49.040
I have been fighting to take the Earth back!

00:13:49.040 --> 00:13:51.810
I will not be dying in a place like this!

00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:53.810
Open it, now!

00:13:53.810 --> 00:13:55.810
What should I do?

00:13:55.810 --> 00:13:58.150
I don't care. Open it for her.

00:14:21.170 --> 00:14:23.840
Just a minute, Seno!

00:14:23.840 --> 00:14:26.850
Why did you let Amick go?

00:14:26.850 --> 00:14:32.120
It's what Amick herself wanted to do. It is no concern of mine.

00:14:32.120 --> 00:14:34.590
You let her go, even knowing that she would die?

00:14:34.590 --> 00:14:37.790
And you can still say it doesn't matter to you!?

00:14:37.790 --> 00:14:40.330
Once a person desires something for themselves,

00:14:40.330 --> 00:14:43.800
I have no right to stop them, no matter what the outcome may be.

00:14:43.800 --> 00:14:48.270
Here, so long as they cause no harm to others, everyone is free.

00:14:48.270 --> 00:14:52.800
That's why even you, a Sleeper, are allowed to go free.

00:14:52.800 --> 00:14:56.140
If you have any objections to that, we can discuss them any time.

00:14:56.140 --> 00:14:59.140
Hmph, so that's the ideal community which you speak of!?

00:14:59.140 --> 00:15:00.110
What!?

00:15:05.820 --> 00:15:07.820
Doug!

00:15:07.820 --> 00:15:09.490
Don't move!

00:15:09.490 --> 00:15:12.490
Doug Vriess! You too!?

00:15:12.490 --> 00:15:16.690
Seno Miyagi! How dare you betray us!

00:15:16.690 --> 00:15:19.500
If only you had minded your own business!

00:15:19.500 --> 00:15:22.500
Lower your gun. I'll only warn you once.

00:15:22.500 --> 00:15:25.300
Shut up! Rebellion is a serious crime!

00:15:25.300 --> 00:15:27.970
In place of the High Council, Seno Miyagi,

00:15:27.970 --> 00:15:29.510
I will carry out your execution!

00:15:29.510 --> 00:15:31.440
Stop! Doug!

00:15:31.440 --> 00:15:37.450
Kaido Yuji? Hmph, why would you stop me?

00:15:37.450 --> 00:15:39.120
You're the same as me!

00:15:39.120 --> 00:15:40.790
Because of this man,

00:15:40.790 --> 00:15:43.460
you have been placed into an obstructed existence here!

00:15:43.460 --> 00:15:46.460
For that matter, how about teaming up with me?

00:15:46.460 --> 00:15:48.790
With those rare B cells of yours...

00:15:48.790 --> 00:15:54.130
You can't just let your abilities rot in a place like this? Hm?

00:15:54.130 --> 00:15:57.470
I... I won't do that...

00:15:57.470 --> 00:15:59.400
Then stay out of my way!

00:16:16.490 --> 00:16:22.160
Fool. I gave him the chance to survive and everything.

00:16:22.160 --> 00:16:28.170
Manipulated by the military
organization-a pitiable man...

00:16:28.170 --> 00:16:31.440
You yourself are being manipulated.

00:16:31.440 --> 00:16:33.840
Freedom? Peace?

00:16:33.840 --> 00:16:37.440
You just want to dispose of those who stand in your way, don't you?

00:16:37.440 --> 00:16:41.740
That's just what the Earth is doing, isn't it!?

00:16:45.780 --> 00:16:48.450
Why don't you answer me, Seno!?

00:16:48.450 --> 00:16:51.460
Why don't you!?

00:16:51.460 --> 00:16:53.120
Yuji...

00:16:53.120 --> 00:16:57.030
Why... Why...!?

00:17:45.440 --> 00:17:47.450
I knew you'd be here.

00:17:47.450 --> 00:17:50.780
Marlene...

00:17:50.780 --> 00:17:52.520
It's begun.

00:17:52.520 --> 00:17:56.890
Apparently, Seno is serious about making Second Earth a permanent residence.

00:17:59.460 --> 00:18:01.580
What were you thinking about?

00:18:03.130 --> 00:18:05.820
Ah, nothing much...

00:18:10.130 --> 00:18:15.410
I was wondering if, by doing this, how long can we possibly survive.

00:18:15.410 --> 00:18:19.140
Really, that's all.

00:18:19.140 --> 00:18:22.480
Is that so...?

00:18:22.480 --> 00:18:23.950
Marlene...

00:18:30.150 --> 00:18:35.150
I... was thinking of going one more time to confirm it.

00:18:36.760 --> 00:18:39.160
Waking up, not having anyone,

00:18:39.160 --> 00:18:43.100
fighting anyway, having everyone die...

00:18:43.100 --> 00:18:46.770
It's just no good like this! That's why I...

00:18:46.770 --> 00:18:50.810
I want to know the truth! If that's the will of the Earth,

00:18:50.810 --> 00:18:55.300
then why is it that I'm here!? The real reason!

00:18:58.780 --> 00:19:02.790
I'm thinking I can't make it up to you for what I did, Yuji.

00:19:02.790 --> 00:19:08.130
But, I'm also thinking that when you awoke, I'm glad it was you, Yuji.

00:19:08.130 --> 00:19:09.130
Marlene...

00:19:09.130 --> 00:19:14.470
Now as well... what's more, from now on,

00:19:14.470 --> 00:19:18.800
I will always be together with you, Yuji.

00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:22.140
No matter what happens...

00:19:22.140 --> 00:19:24.130
Marlene...

00:19:48.430 --> 00:19:51.100
Let's go, to Earth.

00:19:53.100 --> 00:19:55.230
Yuji...

00:21:30.500 --> 00:21:39.990
Although the days when we smiled again and again
hohoemi kasaneta hibi ga

00:21:41.350 --> 00:21:46.120
Have passed away into dreams,
maboroshi ni natte mo

00:21:48.330 --> 00:21:55.270
I will surely not lose my way.
watashi wa kitto mayowanai

00:21:55.390 --> 00:22:01.440
To go on to the future,
mirai ni yuku tame ni

00:22:01.590 --> 00:22:07.860
To become an adult,
otona ni naru tame ni

00:22:08.220 --> 00:22:15.050
I again recall now the memories
mogaite kita omoide wo kokoro de

00:22:15.240 --> 00:22:20.210
twisting in my heart.
ima wa kurikaesu

00:22:20.310 --> 00:22:26.270
I'm living in one time,
hitotsu no toki wo iki

00:22:26.570 --> 00:22:32.550
While choosing two dreams,
futatsu no yume erabi

00:22:33.160 --> 00:22:40.030
And love taught me what it means...
soshite ai ga oshiete kureta yo ne

00:22:40.210 --> 00:22:46.890
to cherish someone.
hito wo omou imi

00:22:50.400 --> 00:22:52.590
<i>The Blue all over South</i> <i>America are on the move,</i>

00:22:52.590 --> 00:22:54.330
<i>headed to one certain spot.</i>

00:22:54.480 --> 00:22:55.480
<i>What does it mean?</i>

00:22:55.660 --> 00:22:56.760
<i>A new aberration?</i>

00:22:56.920 --> 00:22:59.260
<i>At this current stage,</i> <i>there's no positive proof.</i>

00:22:59.260 --> 00:23:02.350
<i>The scouting party isn't seeing</i> <i>any Blue around the Nests.</i>

00:23:02.430 --> 00:23:05.930
<i>I don't think we're</i> <i>all that much influence...</i>

00:23:05.930 --> 00:23:08.510
<i>No matter what, I will</i> <i>be together with you, Yuji.</i>

00:23:08.770 --> 00:23:09.760
<i>I'm going.</i>

00:23:09.860 --> 00:23:13.220
<i>We will find for ourselves the</i> <i>road down which we will live.</i>
